    "title": "'THE KING OF OFF-ROAD,' ROB MACCACHREN, RETURNS TO CORR AS TWO MOTORSPORTS LAUNCHES TWO-TRUCK PRO 2 PROGRAM - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Publishing Firms ,\n1 days ago\nOff-Road Motorsports Hall of Famer reunites with longtime crew chief Dan Sunderland as he returns to the series where he captured the 2008 Pro 2. NASHVILLE, TN, UNITED STATES, October 29, 2026 /EINPresswire.com/ -- TWO Motorsports has announced the signing of Off-Road Motorsports Hall of Famer Rob MacCachren to its inaugural Pro 2 program for the 2026–27 season. MacCachren will pilot the team’s #21 truck alongside team owner and driver Justin Ward in the #7. MacCachren and Ward will make their debut as teammates at the Championship Off-Road Racing (CORR) presented by AMSOIL season opener at Firebird Motorsports Park in Chandler, Arizona on November 19-22.\nRead full article",
